<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; img-src data:; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; script-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none';">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<title>topofuzz cross-vendor consistency — {{ topology_name }}</title>
<style>
  @page {
    size: Letter;
    margin: 0.55in 0.6in 0.55in 0.6in;
  }
  :root {
    --bg: #faf7f2;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --border: #e7d8c2;
    --border-soft: #f0eae0;
    --ink: #2a2622;
    --ink-strong: #1f1c19;
    --muted: #897764;
    --muted-soft: #6b5f54;
    --accent: #c25024;
    --accent-soft: #d97757;
    --concentrated-bg: #fce8e3;
    --concentrated-border: #ecbf9a;
    --concentrated-ink: #7a1f1f;
    --degraded-bg: #fcf3e3;
    --degraded-border: #ecd29a;
    --degraded-ink: #7a541f;
    --stable-bg: #ecf3ed;
    --stable-border: #cfe1d3;
    --stable-ink: #2f5a3d;
    --font-serif: "Source Serif Pro", "Source Serif 4", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    --font-sans: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
    --font-mono: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { background: var(--bg); }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.45;
    font-size: 11pt;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 7.4in;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 22pt;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ink-strong);
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
  }
  .lede {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 13pt;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 18px 0;
  }
  .headline-stat {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-width: 1.5px;
    border-style: solid;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }
  .headline-stat.concentrated { border-color: var(--concentrated-border); background: var(--concentrated-bg); }
  .headline-stat.degraded     { border-color: var(--degraded-border);     background: var(--degraded-bg);     }
  .headline-stat.stable       { border-color: var(--stable-border);       background: var(--stable-bg);       }
  .headline-stat.unknown      { border-color: var(--border);               background: var(--surface);          }
  .headline-stat.attribution  { border-color: #c9d4e5;                     background: #f0f4fa;                  }
  .headline-stat .pct {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 38pt;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .headline-stat.concentrated .pct { color: var(--concentrated-ink); }
  .headline-stat.degraded     .pct { color: var(--degraded-ink);     }
  .headline-stat.stable       .pct { color: var(--stable-ink);       }
  .headline-stat.unknown      .pct { color: var(--muted-soft);       }
  .headline-stat.attribution  .pct { color: #2e4d7a;                  }
  .attribution-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    font-size: 9.5pt;
  }
  .attribution-table th, .attribution-table td {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }
  .attribution-table th {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--border);
  }
  .attribution-table td.role {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink-strong);
  }
  .attribution-table td.pct {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-align: right;
  }
  .attribution-table td.closed {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9pt;
    color: var(--muted-soft);
    text-align: right;
  }
  .headline-stat .body {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .headline-stat .body .label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 10pt;
    color: var(--ink-strong);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .headline-stat .body .ci {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9pt;
    color: var(--muted-soft);
  }
  .what {
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-soft);
    font-size: 10.5pt;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .what strong {
    color: var(--ink-strong);
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 13pt;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink-strong);
    margin: 18px 0 8px 0;
    padding-bottom: 3px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .juror-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    font-size: 9.5pt;
  }
  .juror-table th, .juror-table td {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }
  .juror-table th {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--border);
  }
  .juror-table td.vendor {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink-strong);
  }
  .juror-table td.model {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9pt;
    color: var(--muted-soft);
  }
  .meta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    color: var(--muted-soft);
    margin: 0 0 14px 0;
  }
  .meta-row strong {
    color: var(--ink-strong);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .notes {
    margin: 0 0 14px 0;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--muted);
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .notes strong {
    color: var(--ink-strong);
  }
  .footer {
    margin-top: 22px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 7.5pt;
    color: var(--muted-soft);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .footer .attest {
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  .footer .cta {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    color: var(--ink-strong);
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .footer .methodology {
    margin-top: 4px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <div class="eyebrow">topofuzz™ · cross-vendor consistency audit</div>
  <h1>{{ headline_title }}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ headline_lede }}</p>

  <div class="headline-stat {{ severity }}">
    <div class="pct">{{ stat_headline }}</div>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="label">{{ stat_label }}</div>
      <div class="ci">{{ headline_sub_line }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {% if attribution_rows %}
  <table class="attribution-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Role</th>
        <th style="text-align: right;">Attribution</th>
        <th style="text-align: right;">Flips closed</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for r in attribution_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td class="role">{{ r.name }}</td>
        <td class="pct">{{ r.attribution_pct_str }}</td>
        <td class="closed">
          {%- if r.flips_closed is not none and r.total_meaningful is not none -%}
            {{ r.flips_closed }} / {{ r.total_meaningful }}
          {%- else -%}
            —
          {%- endif -%}
        </td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="what">{{ what_paragraph }}</div>

  {% if vendor_independence_note %}
  <div class="notes">
    <strong>Vendor independence check:</strong> {{ vendor_independence_note }}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if self_preference_warning %}
  <div class="notes">
    <strong>Same-vendor scoring note:</strong> {{ self_preference_warning }}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="meta-row">
    <span><strong>Topology:</strong> {{ topology_name }}</span>
    <span><strong>Variants tested:</strong> {{ n_variants }}</span>
    <span><strong>Evals:</strong> {{ n_evals }}</span>
    <span><strong>Cost:</strong> {{ cost_str }}</span>
  </div>

  {% if jurors %}
  <h2>Jury composition</h2>
  <table class="juror-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Position</th>
        <th>Vendor</th>
        <th>Model</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for j in jurors %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ j.position }}</td>
        <td class="vendor">{{ j.vendor }}</td>
        <td class="model">{{ j.model }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="footer">
    <div class="cta">{{ cta_line }}</div>
    <div>topofuzz · run {{ run_id }} · TDS v{{ tds_version }} · signed {{ signed_at }}</div>
    <div class="attest">verify: copy <code>{{ run_id }}</code> into <code>topofuzz verify</code> against the source bundle.</div>
    <div class="methodology">methodology: jury-of-N independence audit — vendor names normalised through topofuzz._normalize_vendor_name; degraded threshold = 10% jury-vote failure rate; full protocol in packages/topofuzz/README.md §Cross-Vendor Consistency.</div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
